%%{init: {'theme':'neutral'}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant LV as LessonViewer.tsx
    participant PP as PodcastPlayer.tsx
    participant MR as mediaRef (video / audio)
    participant TH as Throttle 5s<br/>(useRef ts)
    participant MUT as progressMutation<br/>(TanStack useMutation)
    participant API as PATCH /api/library/<br/>lessons/:id/progress
    participant H as handlePatchLibraryProgress<br/>(server/routes/library.ts:378)
    participant ST as storage.upsertLibraryProgress<br/>(server/storage.ts:10126)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL<br/>library_progress
    participant TEL as emitLibraryEvent<br/>(activity-telemetry)

    Note over U,DB: Happy path — video/audio timeupdate -> throttled PATCH

    U->>LV: Play lesson (video format)
    LV->>MR: querySelector('video, audio, mux-player')
    MR-->>LV: HTMLMediaElement ref
    LV->>MR: addEventListener('timeupdate', onTimeUpdate)

    loop A cada timeupdate (browser ~250ms)
        MR->>LV: onTimeUpdate(currentTime, duration)
        LV->>TH: reportProgress(format, posSec, durSec)
        alt now - lastTs < 5000ms
            TH-->>LV: skip (throttled)
        else now - lastTs >= 5000ms
            TH->>TH: lastTs = now
            TH->>MUT: mutate({ format, lastPositionSeconds, totalDurationSeconds })
            MUT->>API: PATCH JSON body
            API->>H: auth + Zod parse
            H->>ST: upsertLibraryProgress(userId, lessonId, format, pos, dur)
            ST->>DB: INSERT ... ON CONFLICT (user_id, lesson_id, format)<br/>DO UPDATE SET last_position_seconds, total_duration_seconds,<br/>completed_at = COALESCE(prev, NOW() if >= 95%)
            DB-->>ST: RETURNING row
            ST-->>H: { updated, completed }
            H-->>API: 200 JSON { updated, completed }
            API-->>MUT: response
            MUT->>TEL: emitLibraryEvent('library.progress.upsert', { lesson_id, format, last_position_sec, total_duration_sec, completed })
            alt data.completed === true
                MUT->>MUT: queryClient.invalidateQueries(['library-progress', resolvedId])
                Note over MUT: badge "Concluida" reacende<br/>LibraryResume reaparece<br/>MP picker mostra %
            end
        end
    end

    Note over U,DB: Edge — beforeunload / visibilitychange (best-effort flush, bypass throttle)

    U->>U: Close tab / navigate away
    LV->>LV: window.addEventListener('beforeunload', onUnload)<br/>document.addEventListener('visibilitychange', onUnload)
    LV->>API: navigator.sendBeacon(<br/>  '/api/library/lessons/:id/progress',<br/>  Blob JSON { format, lastPositionSeconds, totalDurationSeconds }<br/>)
    Note over API: sendBeacon = keepalive POST<br/>(spec aceita POST; PATCH via beacon nao garantido).<br/>Server aceita ambos via duplicate route OU<br/>handler comum (decisao implementer).
    API->>H: handle (no body await needed)
    H->>ST: upsertLibraryProgress(...)
    ST->>DB: INSERT/UPDATE
    Note over LV: NAO chama emitLibraryEvent no unload<br/>(unloaded — telemetry pipeline tambem flushed)

    Note over U,DB: Edge — PodcastPlayer (formato audio)

    U->>PP: Play podcast tab
    PP->>PP: <audio onTimeUpdate={(e) => props.onTimeUpdate?.(<br/>  e.currentTarget.currentTime, e.currentTarget.duration)} />
    PP->>LV: onTimeUpdate(cur, dur)
    LV->>TH: reportProgress('podcast', floor(cur), floor(dur))
    Note over LV,TH: mesma throttle 5s compartilhada<br/>entre video + podcast (Map<format, ts>)

    Note over U,DB: Failure — PATCH 401/500

    MUT->>API: PATCH
    API-->>MUT: 401 OR 500
    MUT->>MUT: onError handler (silent in prod)
    alt import.meta.env.DEV
        MUT->>MUT: console.warn('[library-progress PATCH] failed', err)
    end
    Note over MUT,TEL: NAO emite library.progress.upsert<br/>(so emite no success — canary mantem signal-only)
